Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Previously on JoJo's Bizarre Adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.35,0:00:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think you can help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.15,0:00:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to meet an Egyptian\Nfriend I met a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.65,0:00:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hello to Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red Bind!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.87,0:00:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.65,0:00:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may seem like an evil\Nspirit, but it's far from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.27,0:00:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this thing you believe has possessed\Nyou is actually a powerful vision,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,created by your own life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.59,0:00:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This vision will always\Nappear standing by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because of that, we call it a stand!
