Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.07,0:01:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was pulled out of the\NAtlantic, off the coast of Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did a little research.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandfather, Jonathan Joestar, your\Ngreat-grandfather, died while at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out this exact same coffin was\Non that boat with him when he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.41,0:01:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they discovered it four\Nyears ago, it was empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.91,0:01:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I know exactly what was inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.01,0:01:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol and I are trying to\Nlocate him as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That person is evil incarnate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.49,0:01:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his name is Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.63,0:01:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that he has been awakened\Nfrom his hundred-year slumber,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.17,0:01:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is our fate to fight that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.77,0:01:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the neck of this bastard\Non down is Jonathan Joestar!
