Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.59,0:02:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silly boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.01,0:02:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is your goodbye kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a bitch.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.04,0:02:14.80,E7 Signs 2,sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx90\fscy90\pos(1821,483)\be1}Kujo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.07,0:02:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop clinging to me like\NI'm still a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.89,0:02:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.77,0:02:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a giant pain in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.93,0:02:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, it's Jojo! What? Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.53,0:02:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, it is Jojo!\NJojo! Jojo! Hey, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.27,0:02:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.57,0:02:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me, Jojo, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.99,0:02:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't been to school for four days!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.03,0:02:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.63,0:02:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are,\Ngrabbing off to Jojo like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like how friendly\Nyou're getting with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell, ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be careful there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No boobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're freaking annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh he totally said that to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.15,0:03:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
