Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.47,0:04:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.05,0:04:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo fell so far down the steps!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.51,0:04:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he can still move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The branches must have broken his fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did a branch slash open my leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.89,0:04:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what caused me\Nto fall down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.85,0:04:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cut is what came first. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.25,0:04:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, looks like he's able to\Nsummon a pretty fierce stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder he wants me to get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.45,0:04:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:05:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is no match for the power of my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.05,0:05:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it out with the strong style of gold!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.47,0:06:36.43,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,522)\pos(192,865)}Episode 2: Who Will Be the Judge!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.53,0:06:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd have cracked your\Nhead right on the flagstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nasty accidents happen on\Nthose steps all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.23,0:06:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow when you go down these\Nsteps, you really should hold my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, your leg seems to be cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.93,0:07:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might want to wrap it with this\Nhandkerchief to help stop the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.79,0:07:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.87,0:07:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine. It's just a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot to say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.29,0:07:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go to our school?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Noriaki Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.87,0:07:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yes, I just\Ntransferred here yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.75,0:07:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.27,0:07:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.55,0:07:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so his name's Kakyoin.\NSeems pretty cool. You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.49,0:07:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still like Jojo way more than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that time, I was very weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:08:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lacking a body made me vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had not taken\NJonathan Joestar's body...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it hadn't been for his energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to augment my own limited source,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have survived at the bottom\Nof that ocean for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, this body has like a\Nbond between a parent and a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It ties me to his kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.69,0:08:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem to know of my existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and of this power I've gained\Nfrom taking Jonathan's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the Stand that reaches out\Nto the bodies of his descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are always advantages and\Ndisadvantages to every situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will eliminate them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joestar clan must be destroyed soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is every single room in\Nthis house so tiny and cramped?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is exactly why I hate Japan Avdol,\Nhow the hell can you stand being here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.83,0:09:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find it quite fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.09,0:09:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially the tea ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.27,0:09:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ceremony shmaramony.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instant coffee will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, about Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you and I are aware of his existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.77,0:09:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would it not be safe to assume\Nthat he knows about us as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.97,0:09:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.95,0:09:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we don't know\Nwhat he's going to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or for that matter, even\Nwhat powers he has,?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Japanese coffee is absolutely vile!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.75,0:10:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's American coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.51,0:10:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a horrible cut, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.37,0:10:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you get it?
