Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.51,0:10:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some respect and take off that hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.87,0:10:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's poor manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.91,0:10:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop that? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has Jojo ever been hurt in a fight before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.71,0:10:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what caught him, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you do have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.41,0:10:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll assume you were\Nbeing clumsy, you big klutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.99,0:10:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.39,0:10:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut your pants, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like hell you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if I'm gonna treat\Nthat wound, I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ruin him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't know you were so thrifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.80,0:10:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while JoJo's taking off his pants,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take your temperatures and prove\Nyou're nothing but a bunch of fakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.31,0:10:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we really caught a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now just let us go home already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:10:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.97,0:11:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.57,0:11:04.74,Note,note,0,0,0,,{\fs(66)}Jotaro Kujo, today I will murder you with my Stand!\N —Noriaki Kakyoin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.03,0:11:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.79,0:11:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.49,0:11:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just shaking out the\Nthermometer to reset it!
