Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.81,0:11:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Th-that's not a thermometer\Nyou got in your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just say pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.91,0:11:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this look like a pen to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.11,0:11:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.87,0:11:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how stupid are you two boys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.89,0:11:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you honestly think this thermometer\NI'm holding looks like a pen to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.73,0:11:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maybe you need to take a closer look!
