Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.66,0:12:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo, what do you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna stand there and tell me\Nthis thermometer looks like a pen too,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.97,0:12:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such strength, this is no mere woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I saw something weird\Ncrawling up from the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noriaki Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he the one who started this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.99,0:12:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he cut my leg on the stone steps?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:12:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So my stand is currently possessing\Nand controlling that doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.27,0:13:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you attack my stand,\Nyou'll hurt her too, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.73,0:13:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm Noriaki Kakyoin, and the\Nname of my stand here is Hierophant Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.45,0:13:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am human, but I have\Npledged loyalty to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm gonna kill you.
