Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have zero intention of hurting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.99,0:13:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've dragged it\Nout, I see it for what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.55,0:13:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a sleazy stand whose only\Nability is to possess people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.85,0:14:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is your stand? Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This green stripy thing\Nlooks like a shiny melon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragging that out of\Nher was a mistake, Jojo.
