Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't act tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see my finger\Nmarks on your forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.47,0:14:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I decide to crush your Stan's\Nhead like the melon it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'm guessing your\Nhead will get crushed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna keep a tight\Ngrip on you for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna pay my gramps a little visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'd love to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'd like to know\Nmore about Dio myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.93,0:14:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that green liquid coming\Nout of his stand's hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.09,0:14:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have listened, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.11,0:14:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you you're gonna\Nregret this, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.55,0:15:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the attack of my\Nstand, Hierophant Green!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.29,0:15:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No weird moves, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.91,0:15:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you like Emerald Splash?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fluid you saw in Hierophant Green is\Nactually a surge of destructive energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.57,0:15:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It tore straight through\Nyour stand's chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and your insides have\Nnow been torn to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as for that doctor over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I took that stand\Nout of her. So how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.07,0:15:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let me reiterate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.89,0:16:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to warn you that by\Nattacking my hierophant green,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would hurt her as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.09,0:16:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand can travel farther than\Nyours, but it dislikes open spaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.33,0:16:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without exception, it prefers\Nto hide within something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you drag it out, it gets angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why, when you ripped it out of\Nher throat, it hurt her along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who did this to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.65,0:16:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is entirely your fault, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be held responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.13,0:16:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you had to do was let me kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.19,0:16:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the doctor would have\Nwalked away unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.43,0:16:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And still, you get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.89,0:16:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are so pathetic.
