Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:16:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, no one ever said\NJotaro Kujo was a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beat the crap out of\Npeople more than I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some are even still in the hospital.\NI've had idiot teachers who like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to talk big so I taught them a lesson\Nand they never came back to class.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I go to a restaurant, the food's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and make it a policy to\Nstiff him with the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.83,0:17:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even a bastard like me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can spot true evil when he sees it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.37,0:17:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True evil are those who\Nuse the weak for their own
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.69,0:17:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,game and crush them underfoot\Nwhen they're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially an innocent woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that is exactly what\Nyou've done, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.51,0:17:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your stand gets to hide from the\Nvictim, the law, and the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I will judge you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm evil. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.05,0:17:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evil is always the loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the victor who has justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.21,0:18:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The victim being the last man standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how you win in battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is irrelevant.
