Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.65,0:18:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.63,0:18:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The loser's evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.91,0:18:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.33,0:18:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can just deflect\Nthe Emerald Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how evil you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.93,0:18:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you justice...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...with my Stand!
