Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stand has incredible power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.91,0:19:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You caught me by surprise earlier\Nand scratched its chest a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad my stand isn't weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but sometimes it feels like it\Ncan get more savage than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.45,0:19:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine once\Nher wounds are treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did a gaspike just burst?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.75,0:19:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came from the doctor's office!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, stay in the classroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the cleanup to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.79,0:19:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've had enough school for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy needs to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.17,0:19:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hear everything\Nhe knows about Dio.
