Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have the most amazing\Nconnection with my son right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro must be thinking about\Nme at school this very second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not thinking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.93,0:20:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who is that boy on your shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.65,0:20:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that blood that he's covered in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.83,0:20:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell me you did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.41,0:20:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to find the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding someone in this\Nbig house really sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.03,0:20:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you can find him\Nwith Abdul right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both in the tea room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.87,0:20:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never tell me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.35,0:21:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that does is make me\Nworry about you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.67,0:21:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, I know that deep\Ndown you really do mean well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a very sweet little boy at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.19,0:21:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.57,0:21:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking a little bit\Npale this morning. You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.41,0:21:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I hate to say it, but\NBut it's too late for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.65,0:21:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.65,0:21:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a few days\Nbefore he dies at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.31,0:21:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, this is not your fault. Trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.67,0:21:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you want to know why this man swore his
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.71,0:21:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,allegiance to Dio and came\Nto your school to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.19,0:21:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look right here, and I will show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.73,0:21:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.98,0:23:28.99,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.91,0:23:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.27,0:23:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little cold isn't bad from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.63,0:23:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea why I want to either.
